### H6: Forward displacement grows with drive frequency

WHEN c2 and c3 carry sines with c3 lagging c2 by 270 deg and the frequency rises from 1 Hz to 2 Hz or 4 Hz, THE system SHALL travel farther in x, with x over 0.08 m at 2 Hz and over 0.15 m at 4 Hz.

```prediction
